WEBVTT

00:10:57.111 --> 00:11:00.906
Now there's probably going to be
one person in there who hates it.

00:11:00.948 --> 00:11:01.949
(Laughs)

00:11:01.949 --> 00:11:03.867
Guaranteed, there's always one.

00:11:03.867 --> 00:11:05.035
But that's OK.

00:11:05.994 --> 00:11:08.580
Everybody else will remember that moment,

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.249
remember that experience.

00:11:10.916 --> 00:11:12.835
It will be something exciting.

00:11:12.835 --> 00:11:14.002
So consider that.

00:11:15.879 --> 00:11:17.881
As I think about data

00:11:17.881 --> 00:11:22.594
and how we want to live
and change our world,

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:29.017
I'm reminded that sometimes,
data is the pill that we take